WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.177 --> 00:00:05.197
Read the finished run, its recipe and exact input versions. Our three-epoch exercise produced poor scores; that is the observed result.

2
00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:09.940
The run workspace joins per-image measurements back to the input images. Historical rows describe the recorded input version.

3
00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:14.815
Sample dynamics reads F1 across epochs. Not learned after three epochs does not mean this image should be deleted.

4
00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:18.998
Evaluation separates missed labels, invented predictions and class confusion. Read the chosen split and confidence threshold first.

5
00:00:18.998 --> 00:00:23.447
Open the underlying objects, not just a score. Solid boxes are labels; dashed boxes are model predictions.

6
00:00:23.447 --> 00:00:30.280
Findings requires useful model evidence. A weak run or an empty queue is not proof that the labels are correct.
